Z||000006||Kelvin Vivian||07-09-2001||10:54 PM||||You can run your own carfax for free....<P>Someone else posted this tip on this forum:<BR>1. go to <A HREF="http://www.carfax.com" TARGET=_blank>www.carfax.com</A> <BR>2. click on "Account Holders"<BR>3. enter email address "carfax@carfax.com"<BR>4. Enter VIN #... Voila!<P>I tried it real quick, says Carfax doesn't have any info on the car... <P>There were about 4031 86 SE 4-cyls produced.<BR>Makes the car kind of rare...||||reg||14
